{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33956","headline":"奉和鲁望谢惠巨鱼之半 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望谢惠巨鱼之半","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钓公来信自松江，三尺春鱼拨刺霜。\n腹内旧钩苔染涩，腮中新饵藻和香。\n冷鳞中断榆钱破，寒骨平分玉筯光。\n何事贶君偏得所，秖缘同是越航郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}